{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/8b4d6f5f942de3009cca8b78cba1181d.poster.avif?t=1755518000\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/8b4d6f5f942de3009cca8b78cba1181d.webm?t=1755518000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/8b4d6f5f942de3009cca8b78cba1181d.mp4?t=1755518000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><u><strong>Story:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve lost your memory and don\u2019t remember who you are or how you ended up here. But there\u2019s one desire: to survive. Memory recovery is the key to the mystery, and it happens through the pages of a personal diary, where forgotten fragments of your story slowly come together. But what if these entries hide not only the answers, but also what you fear to discover?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/64a5d65ea4141fbe15f4828cc5500e28.poster.avif?t=1755518000\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/64a5d65ea4141fbe15f4828cc5500e28.webm?t=1755518000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Gameplay:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person game that combines elements of investigation, puzzle-solving, and survival. Your memory will be restored as you unravel the mysteries of the motel and fill in the pages of the diary. Each entry in the diary is not only a step towards the truth, but also a revelation of new details about you and the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/135fabda13cb6566690a7864627546ec.poster.avif?t=1755518000\" width=734 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/135fabda13cb6566690a7864627546ec.webm?t=1755518000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/135fabda13cb6566690a7864627546ec.mp4?t=1755518000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>In the game:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intriguing plot where memory recovery becomes a crucial part of the investigation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique VHS effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigation mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/acbe5eae34b1ed839e4dcc935e53199e.poster.avif?t=1755518000\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/acbe5eae34b1ed839e4dcc935e53199e.webm?t=1755518000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/acbe5eae34b1ed839e4dcc935e53199e.mp4?t=1755518000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By navigating through this motel, you will not only uncover the murder mystery but also restore your memory, which may change how you see the world around you. But are you ready for the fact that these memories may not be what you wanted them to be?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/f1495fa77bb73dda98651df2df2ba74c.poster.avif?t=1755518000\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/f1495fa77bb73dda98651df2df2ba74c.webm?t=1755518000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/f1495fa77bb73dda98651df2df2ba74c.mp4?t=1755518000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890570?t=1755518000","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/652c21528319a6636a1f6d3b2577bf4c9bba81d3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755518000","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/0d99ded868d93577b2c573775266bdcbe90544e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755518000","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/0d99ded868d93577b2c573775266bdcbe90544e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755518000","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/8b4d6f5f942de3009cca8b78cba1181d.poster.avif?t=1755518000\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890570/extras/8b4d6f5f942de3009cca8b78cba1181d.webm?t=1755518000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets